<Positioned left="760.00" top="1206.00" width="500.00" height="22.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="13" color="#E8D9BE" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" textAlign="RIGHT" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">2026 秋季特辑 · 追潮汐的人</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1300.00" top="1206.00" width="394.00" height="22.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="13" color="#E8D9BE" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC" textAlign="RIGHT" letterSpacing="2" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">P.024 — 031</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1060.00" top="1150.00" width="640.00" height="20.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="11" color="#6B7684" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">本刊文章人物为虚构创作 · 潮汐数据参考近海典型半日潮</Text></Container></Positioned>
